{"text":"kuruntokai","n":123,"lines":["இருள்திணிந் தன்ன ஈர்ந்தண் கொழுநிழல்","நிலவுக்குவித் தன்ன வெண்மணல் ஒருசிறைக்","கருங்கோட்டுப் புன்னைப் பூம்பொழில் புலம்ப","இன்னும் வாரார் வரூஉம்","பன்மீன் வேட்டத் தென்னையர் திமிலே"],"tr":["iruḷtiṇin taṉṉa īrntaṇ koḻuniḻal","nilavukkuvit taṉṉa veṇmaṇal oruciṟaik","karuṅkōṭṭup puṉṉaip pūmpoḻil pulampa","iṉṉum vārār varūum","paṉmīṉ vēṭṭat teṉṉaiyar timilē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"neytal","tinai_ta":"நெய்தல்","speaker_ta":"தோழி கூற்று","poet_ta":"ஐயூர் முடவனார்","speaker_en":"her friend (tōḻi)","poet_tr":"Aiyūr Muṭavaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 16, veṇcīr 2, vañcicīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 12, veṇṭaḷai 4, oṉṟā vañcittaḷai 1, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"இருள்திணிந்","tr":"iruḷtiṇin","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இருள்","tr":"iruḷ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"திணிந்","tr":"tiṇin"}]},{"text":"தன்ன","tr":"taṉṉa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தன்","tr":"taṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ன","tr":"ṉa"}]},{"text":"ஈர்ந்தண்","tr":"īrntaṇ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஈர்ந்","tr":"īrn"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தண்","tr":"taṇ"}]},{"text":"கொழுநிழல்","tr":"koḻuniḻal","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கொழு","tr":"koḻu"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"நிழல்","tr":"niḻal"}]}],[{"text":"நிலவுக்குவித்","tr":"nilavukkuvit","foot":"puḷimāṅkaṉi","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நில","tr":"nila"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வுக்","tr":"vuk"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குவித்","tr":"kuvit"}]},{"text":"தன்ன","tr":"taṉṉa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தன்","tr":"taṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ன","tr":"ṉa"}]},{"text":"வெண்மணல்","tr":"veṇmaṇal","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வெண்","tr":"veṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மணல்","tr":"maṇal"}]},{"text":"ஒருசிறைக்","tr":"oruciṟaik","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ஒரு","tr":"oru"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிறைக்","tr":"ciṟaik"}]}],[{"text":"கருங்கோட்டுப்","tr":"karuṅkōṭṭup","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கருங்","tr":"karuṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கோட்","tr":"kōṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டுப்","tr":"ṭup"}]},{"text":"புன்னைப்","tr":"puṉṉaip","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"புன்","tr":"puṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னைப்","tr":"ṉaip"}]},{"text":"பூம்பொழில்","tr":"pūmpoḻil","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பூம்","tr":"pūm"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பொழில்","tr":"poḻil"}]},{"text":"புலம்ப","tr":"pulampa","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"புலம்","tr":"pulam"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ப","tr":"pa"}]}],[{"text":"இன்னும்","tr":"iṉṉum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"இன்","tr":"iṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னும்","tr":"ṉum"}]},{"text":"வாரார்","tr":"vārār","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரார்","tr":"rār"}]},{"text":"வரூஉம்","tr":"varūum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வரூ","tr":"varū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"உம்","tr":"um"}]}],[{"text":"பன்மீன்","tr":"paṉmīṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பன்","tr":"paṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மீன்","tr":"mīṉ"}]},{"text":"வேட்டத்","tr":"vēṭṭat","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வேட்","tr":"vēṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டத்","tr":"ṭat"}]},{"text":"தென்னையர்","tr":"teṉṉaiyar","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தென்","tr":"teṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னை","tr":"ṉai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யர்","tr":"yar"}]},{"text":"திமிலே","tr":"timilē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"திமி","tr":"timi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லே","tr":"lē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"இருள்","parts":[{"text":"இருள்","lemma":"இருள்","gloss":"darkness"}],"gloss":"darkness"},{"surface":"திணிந்தன்ன","parts":[{"text":"திணிந்து","lemma":"திணி","gloss":"having become dense"},{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"as if condensed"},{"surface":"ஈர்ந்தண்","parts":[{"text":"ஈர்ந்தண்","lemma":"ஈர்ந்தண்","gloss":"moist and cool"}],"gloss":"moist and cool","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கொழுநிழல்","parts":[{"text":"கொழு","lemma":"கொழுமை","gloss":"thick/rich"},{"text":"நிழல்","lemma":"நிழல்","gloss":"shade"}],"gloss":"thick shade"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நிலவுக்குவித்தன்ன","parts":[{"text":"நிலவு","lemma":"நிலவு","gloss":"moonlight"},{"text":"குவித்து","lemma":"குவி","gloss":"having heaped up"},{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"as if moonlight were heaped up"},{"surface":"வெண்மணல்","parts":[{"text":"வெண்மணல்","lemma":"வெண்மணல்","gloss":"white sand"}],"gloss":"white sand","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஒருசிறை","parts":[{"text":"ஒரு","lemma":"ஒரு","gloss":"one"},{"text":"சிறை","lemma":"சிறை","gloss":"side/wing"}],"gloss":"on one side"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கருங்கோட்டு","parts":[{"text":"கருங்கோட்டு","lemma":"கருங்கோட்டு","gloss":"black-branched"}],"gloss":"black-branched","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"புன்னை","parts":[{"text":"புன்னை","lemma":"புன்னை","gloss":"mastwood tree"}],"gloss":"mastwood tree"},{"surface":"பூம்பொழில்","parts":[{"text":"பூம்பொழில்","lemma":"பூம்பொழில்","gloss":"flowering grove"}],"gloss":"flowering grove","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"புலம்ப","parts":[{"text":"புலம்ப","lemma":"புலம்பு","gloss":"to be lonely/desolate"}],"gloss":"to be lonely"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்னும்","parts":[{"text":"இன்னும்","lemma":"இன்னும்","gloss":"still/yet"}],"gloss":"still"},{"surface":"வாரார்","parts":[{"text":"வாரார்","lemma":"வரு","gloss":"he does not come"}],"gloss":"he has not come"},{"surface":"வரூஉம்","parts":[{"text":"வரூஉம்","lemma":"வரு","gloss":"returning"}],"gloss":"returning"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பன்மீன்","parts":[{"text":"பன்மீன்","lemma":"பன்மீன்","gloss":"many fish"}],"gloss":"many fish","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வேட்டத்து","parts":[{"text":"வேட்டத்து","lemma":"வேட்டத்து","gloss":"of the hunt"}],"gloss":"of the hunt","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"என்னையர்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"},{"text":"ஐயர்","lemma":"ஐயர்","gloss":"elder brothers"}],"gloss":"my brothers"},{"surface":"திமிலே","parts":[{"text":"திமில்","lemma":"திமில்","gloss":"fishing boat"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis particle"}],"gloss":"the fishing boats"}]}],"literal":"Like condensed darkness, the moist, cool, thick shade / like heaped-up moonlight, on one side of the white sand, / while the black-branched mastwood flowering grove is lonely, / he has still not come; returning / are the fishing boats of my brothers who hunt many fish.","translation":"Under the moist, cool, thick shade that looks like condensed darkness, on one side of the white sand that looks like heaped-up moonlight, the flowering grove of black-branched mastwood trees is lonely. He has still not come, but the fishing boats of my brothers, returning from hunting many fish, are already arriving.","modern":"செறிந்த இருளைப் போன்ற குளிர்ந்த அடர்ந்த நிழலையும், நிலவைக் குவித்து வைத்தது போன்ற வெண்மையான மணலையும் உடைய ஒரு பக்கத்தில், கரிய கிளைகளைக் கொண்ட புன்னை மரங்கள் நிறைந்த சோலை தனிமையில் வாட, அவர் இன்னும் வரவில்லை; ஆனால், பல மீன்களை வேட்டையாடிவிட்டு என் அண்ணன்மார்களின் மீன்பிடிப் படகுகள் இதோ திரும்பி வருகின்றன.","explanation":"This poem is set in the Neytal (seashore) landscape, where the theme is the anxiety of waiting. The speaker is the heroine's friend (tōḻi), speaking within earshot of the hero who is secretly waiting nearby. She describes the beautiful coastal grove with its dark, cool shade of black-branched mastwood (puṉṉai) trees and the bright white sand that resembles heaped-up moonlight. While the grove remains lonely without the hero's presence, the fishing boats of the heroine's brothers are already returning from their night-long catch. By pointing out that the brothers are returning, the friend warns the hero that their secret meetings will soon become impossible, subtly urging him to seek a formal marriage. The contrast between the dark shade ('iruḷ') and the bright white sand ('veṇmaṇal') beautifully mirrors the emotional tension of hope and anxiety.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.9],[0.9,1.14],[1.2,1.7],[1.7,2.35],[2.35,3.26],[3.26,3.65],[3.65,4.3],[4.3,4.6],[4.6,5.9],[5.9,6.2],[6.2,6.5],[6.5,6.8],[6.8,7.6],[7.6,7.8],[7.8,8.1],[8.1,8.4],[8.4,8.7],[8.7,9.0],[9.0,9.3]],"female":[[0.0,0.9],[0.9,1.3],[1.4,1.9],[1.9,2.73],[2.73,3.9],[3.95,4.1],[4.1,4.7],[4.7,5.0],[5.0,6.5],[6.5,6.9],[6.9,7.5],[7.5,7.7],[7.7,8.7],[8.7,9.0],[9.0,9.2],[9.2,9.5],[9.5,9.8],[9.8,10.1],[10.1,10.4]]},"sync":[[["இருள்","darkness"],["திணிந்தன்ன","as if condensed"]],[["திணிந்தன்ன","as if condensed"]],[["ஈர்ந்தண்","moist and cool"]],[["கொழுநிழல்","thick shade"]],[["நிலவுக்குவித்தன்ன","as if moonlight were heaped up"]],[["நிலவுக்குவித்தன்ன","as if moonlight were heaped up"]],[["வெண்மணல்","white sand"]],[["ஒருசிறை","on one side"]],[["கருங்கோட்டு","black-branched"],["புன்னை","mastwood tree"]],[["புன்னை","mastwood tree"]],[["பூம்பொழில்","flowering grove"]],[["புலம்ப","to be lonely"]],[["இன்னும்","still"]],[["வாரார்","he has not come"]],[["வரூஉம்","returning"]],[["பன்மீன்","many fish"]],[["வேட்டத்து","of the hunt"]],[["வேட்டத்து","of the hunt"],["என்னையர்","my brothers"]],[["திமிலே","the fishing boats"]]]}